{"3738910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MODEL Debut3 #nicola", "steam_appid": 3738910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fashion game where your unique, cute style comes to life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the latest fashion trends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a new model, enjoy fashion, work, and sometimes romance, while aiming to become a top model!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/0f13d5c7ed13665d8c6b2ae4dab51319.poster.avif?t=1772764138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/0f13d5c7ed13665d8c6b2ae4dab51319.webm?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/0f13d5c7ed13665d8c6b2ae4dab51319.mp4?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own cute model with trendy fashion items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up freely with trendy items approved by the popular  Japanese fashion magazine 'Nicola'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them with trendy hair and makeup to enjoy being stylish just like in real life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/818185a18f73dd032a7d1fb2ec69c8ba.poster.avif?t=1772764138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/818185a18f73dd032a7d1fb2ec69c8ba.webm?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/818185a18f73dd032a7d1fb2ec69c8ba.mp4?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the dream job of being a model!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on various jobs like magazines, TV shows, and fashion shows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In magazine work, experience everything from putting together outfits based on themes, to photo shoots and article layouts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect article where your outfit shines the most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/b66a92e5f5ab42a776d0b012693c69b0.poster.avif?t=1772764138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/b66a92e5f5ab42a776d0b012693c69b0.webm?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/b66a92e5f5ab42a776d0b012693c69b0.mp4?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendships and romance too! Your unique story of growth awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet many unique model friends and boys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, go out together, and experience the glamorous life of a model!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/44148713eb8a9cbee5e338c2a5513dd6.poster.avif?t=1772764138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/44148713eb8a9cbee5e338c2a5513dd6.webm?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/44148713eb8a9cbee5e338c2a5513dd6.mp4?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fashion game where your unique, cute style comes to life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the latest fashion trends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a new model, enjoy fashion, work, and sometimes romance, while aiming to become a top model!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/0f13d5c7ed13665d8c6b2ae4dab51319.poster.avif?t=1772764138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/0f13d5c7ed13665d8c6b2ae4dab51319.webm?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/0f13d5c7ed13665d8c6b2ae4dab51319.mp4?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own cute model with trendy fashion items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up freely with trendy items approved by the popular  Japanese fashion magazine 'Nicola'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them with trendy hair and makeup to enjoy being stylish just like in real life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/818185a18f73dd032a7d1fb2ec69c8ba.poster.avif?t=1772764138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738910/extras/818185a18f73dd032a7d1fb2ec69c8ba.webm?t=1772764138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset